 the domain is enrolled in Encrypted Client Hello. `auto` leaves the decision to Vercel, `enabled` always enrolls, and `disabled` never enrolls and opts out of automatic enrollment.\",\"enum\":[\"auto\",\"disabled\",\"enabled\"],\"example\":\"auto\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"expiresAt\":{\"description\":\"Timestamp in milliseconds at which the domain is set to expire. null if not bought with Vercel.\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"number\"},\"id\":{\"description\":\"The unique identifier of the domain.\",\"example\":\"EmTbe5CEJyTk2yVAHBUWy4A3sRusca3GCwRjTC1bpeVnt1\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"intendedNameservers\":{\"description\":\"A list of the intended nameservers for the domain to point to Vercel DNS.\",\"example\":[\"ns1.vercel-dns.com\",\"ns2.vercel-dns.com\"],\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"name\":{\"description\":\"The domain name.\",\"example\":\"example.com\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"nameservers\":{\"description\":\"A list of the current nameservers of the domain.\",\"example\":[\"ns1.nameserver.net\",\"ns2.nameserver.net\"],\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"renew\":{\"description\":\"Indicates whether the domain is set to automatically renew.\",\"enum\":[false,true],\"example\":true,\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"serviceType\":{\"description\":\"The type of service the domain is handled by. `external` if the DNS is externally handled, `zeit.world` if handled with Vercel, or `na` if the service is not available.\",\"enum\":[\"external\",\"na\",\"zeit.world\"],\"example\":\"zeit.world\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"teamId\":{\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"transferStartedAt\":{\"description\":\"If transferred into Vercel, timestamp in milliseconds when the domain transfer was initiated.\",\"example\":1613602938882,\"type\":\"number\"},\"transferredAt\":{\"description\":\"Timestamp in milliseconds at which the domain was successfully transferred into Vercel. `null` if the transfer is still processing or was never transferred in.\"